column3:
There are various types of catch items with different functions in the world.
Making proper use of these items can help Pathfinders collect more Aniimo;
A <style=Hint_BgL>Tumbler</style> can catch a large number of Aniimo at the same time and is a valuable catch item. In this course, you will learn how to use a <style=Hint_BgL>Tumbler</style> to catch Aniimo.
